	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_03736:
	\L_03729:
	\L_03681:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance, I have a report.'
	\L_03736:
	\L_03729:
	\L_03611:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright.'
	\L_03736:
	\L_03729:
	\L_03681:
	ZH 1:
	'The girl you brought from'
	R
	'Piar’s ship is named Root, and'
	R
	'she’s his actual sister from'
	R
	'before becoming a demon.'
	\L_03736:
	ZH 1:
	'Apparently she was'
	R
	'cryogenically frozen by Piar'
	R
	'200 years ago.'
	\L_03736:
	\L_03729:
	\L_03611:
	ZH 1:
	'I see... 200 years...?'
	R
	'That’s a long time.'
	\L_03736:
	\L_03729:
	\L_03681:
	ZH 1:
	'Also, she had an old disease'
	R
	'called Cascade, so we’ve had'
	R
	'it cured.'
	\L_03736:
	\L_03729:
	\L_03611:
	ZH 1:
	'Cascade... Never heard of it.'
	\L_03736:
	\L_03729:
	\L_03681:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, it was feared as an'
	R
	'incurable disease until about'
	R
	'50 years ago.'
	\L_03736:
	ZH 1:
	'Now there’s a known cure and'
	R
	'the disease has been'
	R
	'eliminated. It’s no surprise'
	R
	'you don’t know about it.'
	\L_03736:
	\L_03729:
	\L_03611:
	ZH 1:
	'So what about her?'
	R
	'Where’s Root?'
	\L_03736:
	\L_03729:
	\L_03681:
	ZH 1:
	'She’s already left the castle.'
	R
	'She said she can’t live a'
	R
	'normal life thinking about'
	R
	'what her brother did...'
	\L_03736:
	ZH 1:
	'Apparently she’s working for a'
	R
	'church.'
	\L_03736:
	\L_03729:
	\L_03611:
	ZH 1:
	'I see...'
	R
	'I don’t really care about that'
	R
	'though, wish I could’ve put'
	R
	'her in my harem...'
